>VpBh
yathābhibhūya sarvāṇi jyotīṃṣy arko 'vatiṣṭhate || 72 || tathābhibhūya karuṇā tava dharmān avasthitā |
>VpBh-A
yathābhibhūya sarvāṇi jotīṃṣiṣo 'vatiṣṭhate || 72 || tathābhibhuta karuṇā tava dharmān avasthitā |
>VpBh-B
yathābhibhūya sarvāṇi jyotīṃṣy arko 'vatiṣṭhate || 72 || tathābhibhūya karuṇā tava dharmān avasthitā |
>VpBh-C
yathābhibhūya sarvāṇi jyotīṃṣy arko 'vatiṣṭhate || 72 || tathābhibhūya karuṇā tava dharmān avasthitā |
>VpBh-D
yathābhibhūya sarvāṇi jyotīṣy arkyo 'vatiṣṭhate || 72 || tathābhibhūya karuṇā tava dharmān avasthitā |
